<title>NETHERLANDS: Profits at ING unit C&amp;E up 6.4 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Profits at ING unit C&amp;E up 6.4 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Profits of Crediet &amp; Effectenbank, a unit of financial services group ING Groep NV (ING) rose 6.4 percent in 1996 to 38.2 million guilders, ING said on Monday.</p>
<p>Results were pressured by an eight million guilder provision for stategic reorientation, the bank said.</p>
<p>Total income increased by 15 percent to 144.8 million guilders, while charges rose 18 percent.</p>
<p>The hidden reserves amounted to 37 million guilders.</p>
<p>The balance sheet total rose to 4.8 billion guilders from 4.2 billion.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
